  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On the fifth floor’s hundredth round of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, the guardian is the phantom image of a desolate beast flying bear. Gu Masters on that field call it the strongest opponent Hei Lou Lan has met since he began challenging the building, and they state that this phantom has only half the strength of the true body.",
        "chapters": [
          581
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Before the round is finished, Fang Yuan already knows from his six-edge owner token that the reward is a rank six phantom path Immortal Gu named flying bear phantom Gu. After the flying bear phantom collapses near death, it turns into white light and becomes that Gu in Hei Lou Lan’s hands, dim and near death from the fight.",
        "chapters": [
          585
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-gu-reward",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan later finds rank six strength path Immortal Gu flying bear strength Gu in the sixty-eighth floor and notes that it can burst out a flying bear phantom in battle. He also recalls that Chang Shan Yin demanded flying bear phantom Immortal Gu from him and owes him resources.",
        "chapters": [
          593
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairing-with-flying-bear-strength-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_flying_bear_strength_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan privately pairs the two in his own plan: flying bear strength Gu with his flying bear phantom Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          594
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairing-with-flying-bear-strength-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
